[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/issues/comments/5413938350","html_url":"https://github.com/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/pull/4711#issuecomment-5413938350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/issues/4711","id":5413938350,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBB1HQ88AAAABQrIkrg","user":{"login":"CarlosJPV","id":57374790,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3Mzc0Nzkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57374790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosJPV","html_url":"https://github.com/CarlosJPV","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosJPV/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosJPV/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosJPV/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosJPV/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosJPV/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosJPV/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosJPV/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosJPV/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosJPV/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-25T17:06:27Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T17:06:27Z","body":"Tested against a live **MiniMed Go + Instinct** account (EU, care partner role) by varying one field at a time. **Your PR's values work** — but I need to correct my earlier comment, which overstated the `os` part. Sorry about that.\n\n**`os` is not required. The actual blocker is a minimum-version gate.**\n\nVarying `appVersion` on `POST {baseUrlCumulus}/display/message`:\n\n| `appVersion` | result |\n| --- | --- |\n| `3.5.0` | 206 `Upgrade application` |\n| `3.6` | 206 `Upgrade application` |\n| `3.6.1` | 206 `Upgrade application` |\n| `3.6.9` | 206 `Upgrade application` |\n| `3.7` | **200 OK** |\n| `3.7.0` | **200 OK** |\n| `3.8` | **200 OK** |\n| `3.8.0` | **200 OK** |\n| `4.0.0` | **200 OK** |\n| `10.0.0` | **200 OK** |\n\nControl: `appVersion: \"3.8.0\"` **without** any `os` field → **200 OK** with full data.\n\nSo the boundary is **≥ 3.7 accepted, ≤ 3.6.9 rejected**. Both `X.Y` and `X.Y.Z` formats are accepted. That explains the symptom exactly: xDrip was sending `3.6.0`, which Medtronic now refuses. Adding `os` is harmless (the real app sends it), it just wasn't the fix.\n\n**Your PR is correct as written** — `3.8.0` clears the gate. Nothing to change.\n\nOne thing worth knowing for the future, because the two version fields behave differently:\n\n- **Discovery path** `/connect/carepartner/v13/discover/android/<ver>` is constrained: `3.5` → Cumulus **v11**, `3.6`–`3.8` → **v13**, and **`3.9` and above fall back to a legacy config** with `baseUrlCumulus = /connect/carepartner/v2` and no Auth0 entry. So `3.8` in the URL is the right ceiling — do not bump it past that.\n- **Body `appVersion`** has no upper bound (`10.0.0` works fine).\n\nIf Medtronic raises the minimum again, only the body value needs bumping; the discovery URL must stay at `3.8`.\n\nHappy to test an APK against my Instinct sensor whenever you have one — same situation as @spindler-ctrl, I'm not set up to build Android. EU account, MiniMed Go, `appModelType: SIMPLERACC`, currently pulling ~500 readings at 1-minute resolution.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/issues/comments/5413938350/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/issues/comments/5423505298","html_url":"https://github.com/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/pull/4711#issuecomment-5423505298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/issues/4711","id":5423505298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBB1HQ88AAAABQ0Qfkg","user":{"login":"jamorham","id":12565568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTY1NTY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12565568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamorham","html_url":"https://github.com/jamorham","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamorham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamorham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamorham/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamorham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamorham/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamorham/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamorham/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamorham/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamorham/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-26T09:45:05Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T09:45:05Z","body":"@benceszasz does this look okay to you?","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/issues/comments/5423505298/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/issues/comments/5430607431","html_url":"https://github.com/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/pull/4711#issuecomment-5430607431","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/issues/4711","id":5430607431,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBB1HQ88AAAABQ7B-Rw","user":{"login":"benceszasz","id":32592661,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTkyNjYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32592661?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benceszasz","html_url":"https://github.com/benceszasz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benceszasz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benceszasz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benceszasz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benceszasz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benceszasz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benceszasz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benceszasz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benceszasz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benceszasz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-26T20:17:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T20:17:09Z","body":"@jamorham yes, everything seems to be fine!\r\n@m0rt4l1n, @CarlosJPV nice work!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/issues/comments/5430607431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]